"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、ガキ大将的な存在だったため、主人公は未だに頭が上がらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は極力、女の子らしく振舞おうとするのだが、結局最後は力技に持っていってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツ万能、細かいことは気にしない性格で、学園内の人気は高い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22456","sourceWorkId":"8809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染でかつ、天敵（？）のような存在。子供の頃はガキ大将的存在で、そのせいか主人公はいまだに頭が上がらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっとも七音自身はその事を恥じていて、極力女の子らしく振舞おうと努力するが、結局最後は得意技のコブラツイストを主人公に見舞うことになってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無所属ながら部活の助っ人を頼まれる事が多い、活動的なスポーツ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真っ直ぐかつ細かい事は気にしない性格と相まって、学園内での人気は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うっ!?　さ、さっきのはつい手が出ちゃっただけで……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50284"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/57df963e90ab02ea9055aa9694a3d98f3877c5cd89bfc8d6fb91f931fe946ff2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9da634ce0ab4decb24dfd101f86ca40b74ffb8aff83688214cdb34097c8b2c5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬 未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:7789","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34271","characterName":"貴水 鈴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50285","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21312"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22457"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34271"},"originalCharacterName":"貴水 鈴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1030"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人びた雰囲気を醸し出すクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会の副会長を務め、その理論的話術で教師をやりこめることもしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その反面、ストレートな言動や独特の雰囲気から、クラスでは浮いた存在になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、本人は気にする様子もなく、一匹狼で行動することが多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22457","sourceWorkId":"8809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特の大人びた雰囲気を持つクラスメイトで、生徒会の副会長を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績は非常に優秀で、教師をやりこめてしまう事もある理論派。その反面、歯に衣着せない言動や同年代とは思えない落ち着いた物腰が周囲に疎外感を与え、クラスでは浮いた存在となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はあまりその事は気にならないらしく、一匹狼的行動をとることが多いが、時折主人公の事を妙に気にかけるような素振りを見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふ、いいわ。そんな風に見られるの、もう慣れてるから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50285"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cce80b64731ffd127956300fa804be3a4a554d52171702dc26b4fc26d4b9b2c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/7760245c06c4cd3aecdf94a4364803ccaa2e6e99f06f451cd4548b3472d17278.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雛見 風香","creatorId":"vndb:s270","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s270","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s270","name":"生天目仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:7786","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34272","characterName":"クゥ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50288","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21312"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22458"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34272"},"originalCharacterName":"クゥ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名前以外、全てが謎に包まれている、神出鬼没な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時々公園で子供達と遊んでいる姿が見られるが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22458","sourceWorkId":"8809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名前以外一切の事がわからない、神出鬼没な謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時々公園で子供達と遊んでいる姿が目撃されるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…………」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50288"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/643aaa1c4fbc5afc2ede8979a7d235984468b744683f123f2e1f4ba41a096b50.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec95f52dcd3dff7df4410e7486ece07db1e9dd861266ce3fe1ae56e527337580.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:7783","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34273","characterName":"大道寺 涼子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50287","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21312"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22461"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34273"},"originalCharacterName":"大道寺 涼子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"911"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトで、委員長を務める内気な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"七音、ともえと親友らしく、よく3人で一緒にいる姿が見受けられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暴走寸前のともえを抑えるのは彼女の役目らしいが、暴走後はさすがに止められない様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折、主人公を熱心に見つめる事があるらしいのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22461","sourceWorkId":"8809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトで、七音の親友。性格は内気で、いつもどことなく自信なさげに喋る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"七音、ともえとよく3人でいる事が多く、暴走寸前のともえを制御するのがいつもの役目（暴走後は流石に止められないらしい） クラス委員長と生徒会書記の兼任でいつも大変そうにしているが、本人は好きでやっているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折、主人公を熱心に見つめている事があるらしいが……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「い、いえ、好きでやってる事ですから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50287"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7ccc0e0a2c3ec3d7787cb6fa149abc06c422bd8b78868af905375120e8c57fa3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a14167520d51f4e11de70ca7ebb5949b0e9d5b5f563888e1f16519ca539f5d62.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金松 由花","creatorId":"vndb:s538","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s538","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s538","name":"井上 みゆ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:7790","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34274","characterName":"萩原 ともえ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"50286","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21312"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22460"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34274"},"originalCharacterName":"萩原 ともえ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"701"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おしゃべり好きな七音の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンションが上がっている時のマシンガントークは、破壊力抜群で誰も手がつけられないほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大のイケメンオタクであり、その情報網はタレントからご近所のアイドルまで網羅している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、主人公は3秒で鼻で笑われたらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22460","sourceWorkId":"8809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトで、七音の親友。世話焼きのおしゃべり好きで、よく七音の恋愛相談に乗っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンションのアップダウンが激しく、本人が盛り上がってる時は、あまりのマシンガントークぶりに誰も手がつけられなくなってしまう事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大のイケメン好きで、タレントからご近所のアイドルまで幅広く情報を網羅している。ちなみに主人公は3秒で鼻で笑われたらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「優れた子孫を残そうという女の本能が、イケメンを求めるの！　それはまさに運命！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50286"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9e7c8e80868baf5f289da89b80f12e2a051fd87c8e512b1b9e2f9c51e7d52f52.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e83a13b40341af447b9009f357f2ce7dffec5a1dd6afb2ee66562012e034156d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金田 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:7793","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34275","characterName":"アリエッタ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"167377","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21312"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22459"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34275"},"originalCharacterName":"アリエッタ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の夢の中に現れる、異世界の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにかを主人公に伝えようとしているのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22459","sourceWorkId":"8809","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界ハーモニアの歌姫で、拓登の夢の中に出てきた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手首と首元から伸びる計6本の紐で城と繋がっており、常にハーモニアへ魔力を送り届けているため、城から外へは出ることが出来ない宿命を背負っている。箱入り娘ならぬ箱入りお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は穏やかで優しい。朗らかな笑顔がよく似合う可愛らしい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわかとした雰囲気に癒される者は多く、周囲からは姫として、またひとりの人間として愛されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を救い出してくれた拓登の事を慕っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"167377"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b519a554017b27a6c05afb7a2c1ba34fcfef8e50f77bd85547e416a858176c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/fffe690621d26a7b7eb39cd0c1a6069c60c12a326b54065122396b01038bf69d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24727:167377:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c123969","characterName":"赤城 美佐子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c123969"},"originalCharacterName":"赤城 美佐子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/ch